<title>HUNGARY: Human to buy 20,000 of its own shares.</title>
<headline>Human to buy 20,000 of its own shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian pharmaceuticals company Human Rt announced on Tuesday that it would buy 20,000 of its own shares via the bourse.</p>
<p>Human did not give further details.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
